//
// Host-only gate for the mixed-method o_ffn_qwen rewire (qwen3_1_7b analogue
// of the qwen3_0_6b one): at seq 2048 the prior all-fused 19-arg layout is
// pinned; at seq 512/1024 the registry's O rows resolve drain but Down
// (seq x 6144 x 2048) has no short-seq rows yet, so builder and host plan
// both refuse with the same KeyError (mixed builds are future registry
// data); and the host scratch plan mirrors the builder's scratch_for
// contract. IR/compile level: no device, no aircc, no downloads. Collected
// by the unfiltered check-programming-examples.
//
// RUN: %PYTHON %S/test_o_ffn_layout.py | FileCheck %s
//
// CHECK: PASS  test_checked_plan_binds_the_cache_to_the_registry
// CHECK: PASS  test_seq2048_layout_is_the_prior_all_fused_one
// CHECK: PASS  test_short_seq_mixed_rows_are_future_data
// CHECK: PASS  test_the_host_scratch_plan_matches_the_builder_contract
// CHECK: o_ffn layout tests: 4/4 passed
